{"name": "One Must Rule", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"ONLY ONE WILL RULE\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"72\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/71bc0c6f82a653660273f2313e02a465.avif?t=1790666051\" width=\"553\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"670\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/b8e33f654b3ada2ec6f31cef84fb323a.poster.avif?t=1790666051\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/b8e33f654b3ada2ec6f31cef84fb323a.webm?t=1790666051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/b8e33f654b3ada2ec6f31cef84fb323a.mp4?t=1790666051\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your chosen ruler and guide their rise from a simple settlement to a massive empire. Rule from the council table, discover game-breaking synergies, and conquer the asynchronous PvP arena. Every choice carries weight, only one will stand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"FORGE YOUR STRATEGY\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"72\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/3a718132c6cf9f7f5804da268700e2dc.avif?t=1790666051\" width=\"593\"/></span><br/> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"670\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/3d9b446393350ef10e18390240c76ca3.poster.avif?t=1790666051\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/3d9b446393350ef10e18390240c76ca3.webm?t=1790666051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/3d9b446393350ef10e18390240c76ca3.mp4?t=1790666051\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decree you sign at the council table shapes the fate of your army on the open battlefield. Choose and upgrade your cards, combine powerful synergies, and bear the responsibility of your choices as your tactical decisions turn into chaotic victories or crushing defeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2028<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"CHOOSE YOUR RULER\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"72\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/2e67266d599294122b2a89fe76019bd8.avif?t=1790666051\" width=\"555\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"670\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/5c91c4948570e3c9a5b0a9b425e3c900.poster.avif?t=1790666051\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/5c91c4948570e3c9a5b0a9b425e3c900.webm?t=1790666051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/extras/5c91c4948570e3c9a5b0a9b425e3c900.mp4?t=1790666051\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your leader and command unique starting values and Special Abilities. Adapt your strategy to each Ruler\u2019s distinct strengths, leverage their advantages at the council table, and forge a tailored path to victory in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An empire-building auto-battler set in a harsh medieval settlement where every strategic command shapes your kingdom\u2019s fate. Build your empire from the council table, discover game-breaking card synergies, and battle against rival players. Every choice counts, only one will rule!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424940/843cf37917fa58b6edc5f57b4880a5217777f25a/header.jpg?t=1790666051", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Asynchronous Multiplayer", "Card Battler", "Card Game", "Deckbuilding"], "developers": "Violet Interactive", "publishers": "Violet Interactive", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4424940", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 September 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ls23U6E0JWY", "first_seen": 1790632800.0, "review_rank": 25}